[{"title":"玉茗花二首 其一","author":"谢薖","text":"佳园昨夜变春容，清晓惊开玉一丛。\n素质定欺云液白，浅妆羞退鹤翎红。\n似闻金谷初无种，欲画鹅溪恐未工。\n底事馀花避三舍，孤高元有史君风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":63,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"玉茗花二首 其二","author":"谢薖","text":"骚人浪说麻源谷，本在风流刺史家。\n直与瑶林共高彻，可须梅影斗横斜。\n芳尊莫待红妆赏，幽艳长令烈士嗟。\n凭仗边鸾折枝手，应宜展障玉鸦叉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":64,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谩成","author":"谢薖","text":"年来任运学腾腾，爱酒还同醉李僧。\n痛饮亡何缘客至，时奇不惜绕村行。\n檐间燕雀新声好，门外池塘春水生。\n晓起坐窗无一事，捲书南望见高棱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":65,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"饮酒示坐客","author":"谢薖","text":"身前不吝作虫臂，身后何须留豹皮。\n劬劳母氏生育我，造化小儿经纪之。\n牙筹在手彼为得，块石支头吾所师。\n偶逢名酒辄径醉，儿童拍手云公痴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":66,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和李智伯金石台不见旧题之作 其一","author":"谢薖","text":"瘗鹤书踪逸少齐，华阳长使后人迷。\n姓名不得芙蓉手，何用全牛捧砚题。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":67,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和李智伯金石台不见旧题之作 其二","author":"谢薖","text":"复忆高人张季鹰，每将杯酒胜荣名。\n登临叔子缘何事，湮灭无闻一怆情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":68,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"悼亡三首 其一","author":"谢薖","text":"旧闻林下趣，既见即心降。\n月冷同秋梦，灯寒对夜窗。\n孰知身是幻，深念涕如江。\n仰叹朝飞雉，微禽亦有双。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":69,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"悼亡三首 其二","author":"谢薖","text":"三公吾岂敢，宁为忍饥寒。\n拟听笭箵雨，潜悲苜蓿盘。\n烟云昏壁月，霜露殒香兰。\n伫立东风泣，忘情良独难。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":70,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"悼亡三首 其三","author":"谢薖","text":"去作三泉隔，来归二载馀。\n临风还念汝，伤女更怜渠。\n憔悴衣围减，漂零鬓发疏。\n吾今多病久，谁付茂陵书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":71,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"呈无逸兄","author":"谢薖","text":"汉儒章句文胜质，鲁国衣冠实愧名。\n但遣诗书长在眼，可令声利苦关情。\n咄嗟苟饮有时办，梦想溪堂何日成。\n舟泊寒沙卧明月，此期终欲与君盟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":72,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"示舍弟","author":"谢薖","text":"萧然环堵独何有，自谓过人唯一丘。\n野性定为沧海客，妙龄须寄道山游。\n江寒沙静鹡鸰晚，云阔天低鸿雁秋。\n休叹乌衣成往事，一尊相对且忘忧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":73,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄桃邻居士","author":"谢薖","text":"桃邻野客无消息，寄食招提岂定居。\n倘有庞公知德操，何须程郑识相如。\n食鱼他日劳弹铗，舐痔今人剩得车。\n流落生涯俱寂寞，因风时遣一行书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":74,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄无逸四首 其一","author":"谢薖","text":"三足祥乌曾集冠，平生菽水奉亲欢。\n从今五鼎应无补，不可奈何君自宽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":75,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄无逸四首 其二","author":"谢薖","text":"闻说潘郎窘食贫，何年会面慰艰勤。\n北风如有齐安便，为报相思频梦君。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":76,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄无逸四首 其三","author":"谢薖","text":"故园风物长如旧，松柏参天六月凉。\n岑寂北窗风雨夜，独吟诗句绕胡床。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":77,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄无逸四首 其四","author":"谢薖","text":"浩荡漳江泻碧漪，西山清绝助新诗。\n好因归雁传佳句，要见羊何共和之。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":78,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观李伯时阳关图二首 其一","author":"谢薖","text":"坐对丹青伤别离，泪和朝雨想频挥。\n道边垂柳年年在，看尽行人长不归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":79,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观李伯时阳关图二首 其二","author":"谢薖","text":"春草春波伤底事，青青柳色最消魂。\n龙眠自有离家恨，猊得阳关烟雨昏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":80,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋兴","author":"谢薖","text":"雨隔千山暮，风惊一叶秋。\n朱颜伤露槿，青眼赖沙鸥。\n畏酒游扬梦，因诗点染愁。\n有怀谁与语，多病独登楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":81,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"听曹道士弹琴二首 其一","author":"谢薖","text":"淡泊綵弦谁与听，试开尘匣写幽情。\n琴中自有无穷怨，弹出离骚意外声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":82,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"听曹道士弹琴二首 其二","author":"谢薖","text":"小窗疏箔列仙家，弹尽遗音晚景斜。\n贺老当年定场屋，虚将妙曲付琵琶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":83,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寒食出郊","author":"谢薖","text":"水晴鸥弄影，沙软马惊尘。\n密竹斜侵径，幽花乱逼人。\n深行听格磔，倦憩倚轮囷。\n往事悲青冢，年年芳草新。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":84,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄洪鸿父二首","author":"谢薖","text":"儿时访道漳江上，燕雀群中见阿鸿。\n南浦飞云看画栋，北窗攲枕飒凉风。\n读书长忆登山胜，作尉聊甘食荠穷。\n想见咏怀非一首，钩章棘句定能工。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":85,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有怀潘子真","author":"谢薖","text":"冲和庵里潘居士，旅食京城久不还。\n玉唾银钩长在眼，瑶林琪树未承颜。\n大门曾是郑严辈，吾子却居夷惠间。\n想见红尘车马底，梦魂随雁过西山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":86,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"食菜","author":"谢薖","text":"道人真是伊蒲塞，顿顿园蔬入馔来。\n紫芥寒菹参薤韭，黄橙苦酒伴盐梅。\n蒸豚不羡贮人乳，饭豆亦能羹芋魁。\n但恐酪奴不解事，搅令枵腹转春雷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":87,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"暮春二首 其一","author":"谢薖","text":"溜渠鸣玉雨成霖，春草池塘数尺深。\n后院落花人不到，无聊独下海棠阴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":88,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"暮春二首 其二","author":"谢薖","text":"晚雨墙东暗绿槐，清阴庭院锁莓苔。\n委阶红药将春去，贴水青荷与夏来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":89,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日黄梅花二首 其一","author":"谢薖","text":"腊梅初与雪争妍，素艳寒香亦可怜。\n政使北风吹得尽，一枝金蓓始嫣然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":90,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日黄梅花二首 其二","author":"谢薖","text":"傍人如笑不胜妍，曾是寻芳向腊前。\n纵使游蜂能拂掠，含酸结子为谁圆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":91,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花四首 其一","author":"谢薖","text":"姑射神游阅九关，水精宫殿不胜寒。\n下窥人世生尘想，故作梅花与俗看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":92,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花四首 其二","author":"谢薖","text":"清晓微开浅浅黄，萧疏无奈北风凉。\n幽姿不许人窥见，故向寒林度暗香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":93,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花四首 其三","author":"谢薖","text":"蔷薇露染玉肌香，疏影寒光照野塘。\n长使诗人动幽兴，不妨桃李斗春妆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":94,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花四首 其四","author":"谢薖","text":"冷香零乱点寒莎，眼底愁生万种多。\n收拾馀芳无处惜，只传佳句似阴何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":95,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送都仲献","author":"谢薖","text":"酒曹怀璧暂投閒，俄许朱轓未赐环。\n殿阁凉生应在眼，宫门驺唱合趋班。\n凤皇观德翔千仞，虎豹窥人碍九关。\n只恐苍生倾望久，未容投绂老家山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":96,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题长沙高善时醉月堂","author":"谢薖","text":"乱山岑秀绕湘坟，君筑茅堂底处村。\n蛮国戈矛真梦幻，醉乡风露别乾坤。\n平生不负南楼兴，何日能同北海尊。\n聊欲挥毫书楚些，凭君招取独醒魂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":97,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与江君佐游五福寺观竹二首 其一","author":"谢薖","text":"老子平生与竹群，清风洒濯胜三熏。\n江郎定自兴不浅，共打僧门寻此君。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":98,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与江君佐游五福寺观竹二首 其二","author":"谢薖","text":"小池环插碧琅玕，气韵萧梢六月寒。\n一夜清霜群木落，独留孤节与君看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":99,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吴彩鸾写真","author":"谢薖","text":"天上凤皇难独宿，人间翡翠本双栖。\n丹青不共文萧共，谁遣雉东迷雀西。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":100,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏咏鼠须笔","author":"谢薖","text":"编须将取猬毛磔，裁管縳成鸡距长。\n谁言鼠须不足齿，也复论功翰墨场。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":101,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山间四首 其一","author":"谢薖","text":"篱落秋花未得霜，嫣然一笑媚秋阳。\n可人风味撩诗兴，不记姚家宫样黄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":102,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山间四首 其二","author":"谢薖","text":"野老缘冈拾堕樵，溪童收网度横桥。\n高怀尽在行歌里，岂信人间有市朝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":103,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山间四首 其三","author":"谢薖","text":"未羡颜生乐一箪，一箪悬磬若为欢。\n有田如使扬雄足，亦学前贤在涧槃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":104,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山间四首 其四","author":"谢薖","text":"举案齐眉老孟光，隐居无计可须忙。\n残年但使糟床注，亦付生涯与醉乡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":105,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"移松二首 其一","author":"谢薖","text":"古貌苍髯十八公，巍巍独出众材中。\n朝来挽致茅堂下，为我商量送好风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":106,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"移松二首 其二","author":"谢薖","text":"河出昆崙派九州，屹然砥柱立中流。\n苍松若比丘山重，岂但回头费万牛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":107,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵吴民载告别觅酒二首 其一","author":"谢薖","text":"君诗起予者，百遍为君开。\n世俗唯何甚，予心不可谐。\n独思南去楚，众欲北之回。\n何处可休影，期君归去来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":108,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵吴民载告别觅酒二首 其二","author":"谢薖","text":"齐下老从事，相逢青眼开。\n有朋方悃款，得汝更诙谐。\n老兴此非浅，后车君与回。\n嘉蔬实空甒，并遣木奴来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":109,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶书二首 其一","author":"谢薖","text":"大儒读书如布谷，小儿据几如王孙。\n道人竟日无一事，卧看前江烟雨昏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":110,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶书二首 其二","author":"谢薖","text":"平生蹇吃不解语，终日坐窗从客嘲。\n它年若使登要路，定被人讥无口匏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":111,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题陈先生华山高卧图","author":"谢薖","text":"落叶开花秋复春，睡中荣悴岂关身。\n那知五起鸡三唱，亦有寒窗不寐人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":112,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和董彦光立春日二首 其一","author":"谢薖","text":"梅蕊飞翻柳色新，雪泥乾尽已成尘。\n愁看节物独惊眼，醉吐诗词君可人。\n藜杖应门原宪病，鹴裘贳酒茂陵贫。\n朝来似有飞扬意，可但无情草木春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":113,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和董彦光立春日二首 其二","author":"谢薖","text":"交情自昔白头新，富贵移人或望尘。\n顾我喜求方外士，得君端是眼中人。\n谪仙诗富旧无敌，东野囊空今不贫。\n已遣掺掺缝古锦，共搜佳句赏新春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":114,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"彦光示诗有释氏之语复次韵","author":"谢薖","text":"历眼浮荣逐日新，谁知澄寂本非尘。\n吾曹例作区中士，此味全输世外人。\n空里华生均是病，衣中宝在却忧贫。\n是间枯淡君姑置，且办芳尊醉早春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":115,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"何之忱用前韵示诗复次韵","author":"谢薖","text":"扬子牢愁更美新，贾生悲鵩在承尘。\n忘怀久已栽萱草，行乐尤欣见玉人。\n邂逅题诗聊可意，平生嗜酒岂忧贫。\n明年剩作颠茫计，剧饮狂歌莫负春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":116,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"从陈妙音觅酒二首 其一","author":"谢薖","text":"雪窗痴坐拨寒灰，万斛清愁扫不开。\n排遣此怀将底物，凭君催送曲生来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":117,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"从陈妙音觅酒二首 其二","author":"谢薖","text":"长恐闺人抱颈羞，何当更脱鹔鹴裘。\n试烦郎子倾家酿，不用平原老督邮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":118,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵董彦孚独卧逸堂之句","author":"谢薖","text":"绕舍檀栾五月凉，岁寒高节亦难忘。\n期君鸿鹄应高举，顾我蚍蜉岂自量。\n索价旧曾晞少室，荷锄犹可继柴桑。\n虚堂若许连床卧，待看风吹细细香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":119,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送黄柑与彦孚二首 其一","author":"谢薖","text":"残腊才经一番霜，青青三寸作金黄。\n故园兄弟怀思我，特地分甘到草堂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":120,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送黄柑与彦孚二首 其二","author":"谢薖","text":"手拆奇苞遗细君，更思特送逸堂人。\n甘寒定可锦绣口，看吐新诗泣鬼神。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":121,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过金山下作","author":"谢薖","text":"扬子江中风浪生，小舟如叶任攲倾。\n桨摇齐指金山寺，雾暗初疑铁瓮城。\n绝顶迥分双塔秀，层楼危立一僧清。\n他年来访结庵地，吾与此江春水盟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":122,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"独登有美堂","author":"谢薖","text":"龟趺双跱日星悬，读罢凭阑心浩然。\n缭绕峰峦浮野色，参差楼阁起晴烟。\n湖光净照山间寺，江浪遥连海外天。\n安得翰林风月手，一时摩写入诗篇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":123,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨中漫成四首 其一","author":"谢薖","text":"东风浑作勒花寒，寂寞林塘不受看。\n玉版鹤翎俱未识，梨梢空有泪阑干。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":124,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨中漫成四首 其二","author":"谢薖","text":"向老逢春懒问花，恶风吹雨故斜斜。\n一城桃李应漂尽，不到城南韦杜家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":125,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨中漫成四首 其三","author":"谢薖","text":"一树山矾宫样黄，晓风微送雨中香。\n鼻端空寂谁知许，莫怪雄蜂取次狂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":126,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨中漫成四首 其四","author":"谢薖","text":"才见花飞扫不开，只今青子落莓苔。\n当时一笑冰雪面，曾动扬州诗兴来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":127,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送王山人","author":"谢薖","text":"秋风萧瑟赋归欤，此去悬知金有鱼。\n我亦羡君无夺糈，长沙终负过秦书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":128,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"滴滴金花","author":"谢薖","text":"满庭黄色抑何深，一滴梅霖一滴金。\n莫使贪夫来见此，闻名亦起觊觎心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":129,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"洗墨池","author":"谢薖","text":"张芝学书池水黑，章草如芝古无敌。\n右军睥睨难抗衡，恨不临池作书痴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":130,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"代柬仲彝索酒","author":"谢薖","text":"月色皎如许，其如无酒何。\n从君觅一斗，午夜泛金波。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":131,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春闺","author":"谢薖","text":"曲栏干外柳垂垂，罗幕轻风燕子飞。\n独倚危槛思往事，落红撩乱点春衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":132,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿文殊寺","author":"谢薖","text":"踏破春云深万层，山灵放我作幽行。\n花香掠面不知处，鸟语可人如有情。\n风急远闻檐马响，月高清送木鱼声。\n禅床光滑氍毹软，曲臂支头听瀑倾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":133,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"括苍洞","author":"林晨","text":"落日泉声咽梵宫，依檐山色翠摩空。\n刘晨去后门长启，时见桃花满地红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":134,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂","author":"林灵素","text":"四十五岁劳生，浮名满世峥嵘。\n只记神霄旧路，中秋月上三更。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":135,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吕洞宾","author":"林灵素","text":"捻土为香事有因，世间宜假在宜真。\n洞宾却识林灵素，灵素何尝识洞宾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":136,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}}]